55    write(22, "{\"parentUuid\":\"c6474780-61c1-4164-80c2-e7b6f7ef12aa\",\"isSidechain\":false,\"promptId\":\"4917880d-e804-4892-ac33-20a9214d6e88\",\"type\":\"user\",\"message\":{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":[{\"tool_use_id\":\"toolu_01P715V488jFwGBfc1UVADrT\",\"type\":\"tool_result\",\"content\":\"1\\t# AI Parsing Guidelines for Feedback to Linear\\n2\\t\\n3\\tThis document provides detailed guidelines for parsing raw user feedback into structured Linear issue data.\\n4\\t\\n5\\t## Overview\\n6\\t\\n7\\tThe parsing process extracts six key components from each feedback item:\\n8\\t1. Title\\n9\\t2. Description\\n10\\t3. Labels\\n11\\t4. Priority\\n12\\t5. Acceptance Criteria\\n13\\t6. Estimate\\n14\\t\\n15\\t## 1. Title Extraction\\n16\\t\\n17\\t### Rules\\n18\\t- **Format**: Imperative mood (e.g., \\\"Fix crash on upload\\\", not \\\"The app crashes\\\")\\n19\\t- **Length**: Maximum 80 characters\\n20\\t- **Specificity**: Include key details from feedback (device, size, action, context)\\n21\\t- **Clarity**: Should stand alone without reading description\\n22\\t- **Actionable**: Start with verb when possible\\n23\\t\\n24\\t### Specificity Guidelines\\n25\\t\\n26\\t**AVOID generic titles:**\\n27\\t- \342\235\214 \\\"Fix bug\\\"\\n28\\t- \342\235\214 \\\"Add feature\\\"\\n29\\t- \342\235\214 \\\"Improve performance\\\"\\n30\\t- \342\235\214 \\\"Fix crash\\\"\\n31\\t\\n32\\t**INCLUDE relevant context from feedback:**\\n33\\t- \342\234\205 \\\"Fix crash when uploading large images on iPhone 14\\\"\\n34\\t- \342\234\205 \\\"Add dark mode toggle in settings\\\"\\n35\\t- \342\234\205 \\\"Improve image loading performance on slow connections\\\"\\n36\\t- \342\234\205 \\\"Fix crash on login with SSO accounts\\\"\\n37\\t\\n38\\t### Context Extraction\\n39\\t\\n40\\tExtract and include these details when present in feedback:\\n41\\t- **Device/Platform**: iPhone 14, Android 12, Chrome\\n42\\t- **Size/Scale**: large images, bulk operations, many items\\n43\\t- **Action/Trigger**: when uploading, on login, during save\\n44\\t- **Condition**: on slow connections, with SSO, when offline\\n45\\t- **Location**: in settings, on dashboard, in checkout\\n46\\t\\n47\\t### Examples\\n48\\t\\n49\\t| Raw Feedback | Generic (\342\235\214) | Specific"..., 78788) = 78788
